	(text "PCB PLACEMENT NOTES:\n- U9 (ESD) right at J2, before D+/D- reach U1.\n- Route USB_DP/USB_DM as a short tight pair.\n- Optional: 1-4.7uF cap on VBUS near J2 (none on schematic now)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 180.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 194 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "30a75d03-e301-469c-932b-8260b4283269")
	)
	(text "USB-C: bench flashing / serial via ESP32-C3 native USB-Serial/JTAG (GPIO18/19).\n5.1k CC pull-downs = UFP (sink). U9 USBLC6 ESD on D+/D- and VBUS. VBUS diode-ORs into +5V on the Supplies page."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
